# Patch @react-pdf/textkit 6.3.0 for Arabic PDF export
#
# react-pdf's textkit bidi reordering is buggy for Arabic: reorderLine() throws
# "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'id')" when reordering Arabic
# glyph runs, and mirrorString() double-mirrors parentheses in Arabic text.
#
# Our PDF documents pre-shape and pre-reorder every Arabic string to final
# visual order with rtlText() (src/lib/pdf.ts) and lay text out LTR, so both
# textkit steps are redundant for this app. They are neutered here.
#
# Re-applied automatically by patch-package on `npm install` (see postinstall).
#
